User reply: 我在试用期，每周只申请一天。", "answerable": true, "reference_answer": "Probationary employee needs HR approval even for one remote day.", "gold_evidence": [{"document_id": "26a179c5b2c1409295f1f1b0c66565bc", "page": 7, "text": "REMOTE-26 current remote work policy: Regular employees may request up to two remote days per week with team lead confirmation. Requests above two days require an HR exception approval. Probationary staff require HR approval even for one day. A schedule does not constitute approval."}], "answer": "基于你自报的试用期员工身份和每周申请一天，远程办公申请仍须取得人力资源部门（HR）审批；该判断以自报事实为前提，尚待雇主确认。 [1] [5]

每周一天的排期本身不构成审批。 [1]"}
